<title>POLAND: SOCCER-POLAND BEAT GEORGIA 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-POLAND BEAT GEORGIA 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KATOWICE, Poland 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland beat Georgia 4-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-1) in their World Cup European zone group two</p>
<p>qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Poland - Adam Ledwon 33, Miroslaw Trzeciak 35, Krzysztof</p>
<p>Bukalski 70 penalty, Krzysztof Nowak 89</p>
<p>Georgia - Shota Arveladje 24</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000</p>
</text>
